      "t": "li",
      "text": "Shipped on Steam, reaching 10,000+ claims in its first 100 hours.",
      "font": "Roboto:Regular 400 20px"
    },
    {
      "t": "li",
      "text": "Engineered a CSV-to-Unreal-to-Wwise dialogue pipeline with branching playback that selects lines from cached player choices and world state, so 56 pages of dialogue\nwere authored outside the build.",
      "font": "Roboto:Regular 400 20px"
    },
    {
      "t": "li",
      "text": "Scripted mechanics, levels, and sequencing for 22 single-player scenes in Blueprints, covering AI direction, dialogue events, Blackboard checks, the save system, coded animations, and player pathing.",
      "font": "Roboto:Regular 400 20px"
    },
    {
      "t": "li",
      "text": "Technical Director for 18+ contributors across audio, design, programming and writing; ran the AWS EC2 Perforce server for 30+.",
